    CityWide booth, of the Grapevine Meeting, of La Viña's monthly workshop: their series' page is the one to find,
    event-share-series.njk), theirs to describe (Grapevine's and La Viña's own calendars: their pages), or over —, at
    the address its card's Share button sends (/events/<anchor>/). Before round 37 a small page that sent people on to
    the card (src/pages/event-share.11ty.js, gone); now the same full page as an indexable one
    (src/_includes/partials/event-page.njk): its card, its series' next dates, "Get ready", what comes next … An event
    that is over shows no way to join it (no Join, no meeting ID, no calendar menu, its summary without how to join).
    Once the event leaves data/site/events.json the address is a 404, which sends people on to /events/
    (src/assets/js/community.js). -#}
